[h3][b]Can you feel that new year's vibe?[/b][/h3]

It's been almost a month since the last update, and we're already excited to present you with a new one! Meet the New Year update with the home trio of our Main Hero - Christie, Kat and Mary! New Year's Eve is upon us, and you find yourself locked in the same apartment with the beauties... What will you do? It's time to give gifts to Christy and Mary, but don't forget to give time to Kat while watching a movie together. 

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2706300/MILFs_Plaza

[h3][b]WHAT YOU'LL SEE:[/b][/h3]
[list][*] New Year's event;
[*] 3 hentai scenes;
[*] 3 new animations;
[*] Festive decoration of the apartment for the duration of the event;
[*] Presents![/list] [img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44774059/17cd20fcb23b01bf0cfa4834e6890b84b97c319a.png[/img]

[b]Of course we didn't forget about fixing the bugs we encountered during this time... And here's what we managed to fix:[/b]
[list][*] Fixed a bug where Mary could leave the house and not return for several days;
[*] Fixed a bug where Igor could leave the park and not return for several days;
[*] Fixed a bug that caused one of the elite pouches in the Nancy (librarian) quest to disappear;
[*] The New Year's Eve scene caps in the gallery have been replaced with the final images;
[*] Fixed music in some scenes;
[*] Fixed a bug that could cause sprites in New Year scenes to stand in the wrong direction (too close to each other, standing with their backs to each other, etc.);
[*] Added mention of the “gamcore” site in the credits;
[*] Fixed comic bubble fonts for German, Polish, Portuguese, and all Asian languages;
[*] Also many minor fixes for German, Polish, Portuguese, Spanish, Turkish, Dutch, and all Asian languages.[/list] [h2][b]Still actively working on the first DLC - “Beach Series”! Expect it next year![/b][/h2]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44774059/b8dd2ed2e6ad64ac4985369815f9826db54b4411.png[/img]
[h3][b]Also, from December 19 to January 2, there is a New Year's Sale 2024 on Steam! Buy my game as well as all Bonus Content at 25% off if you haven't already done so before![/b][/h3]

